### Download part of an object with the Range header

Source: https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-js-v3/blob/main/preview/lib-transfer-manager/README.md

Set the Range header on the request to download only part of an object. This works with multipartDownloadType and returns just the requested bytes.

```javascript
// Download the first 5 MB only
const download = await tm.download({
  Bucket: "source-bucket",
  Key: "some-key",
  Range: "bytes=0-5242879",
});

const data = await download.Body?.transformToByteArray();
console.log(`Downloaded ${data.byteLength} bytes`);
```

